  storyText: "Eject Failed\n\nYou yank at the shard. It won't move. Pain shoots behind your eyes.\n\nMirage: \"Please stop! NetWatch has a trace running through me. If you rip me out mid-trace, it hits your brain instead.\"\n\n1. Force it out.\n2. Stop. Let go."
